{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2623\ufe0f\u00a0<strong>Survive the end. Build your deck. Face the dead.\u00a0</strong>\u2623\ufe0f</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4003430/extras/04f91b7be7282cc1f4aaee3a919b83a9.avif?t=1758950544\" width=1560 height=458 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world is gone, but the fight isn\u2019t over. In <strong>GGNZ: Deck of the Dead</strong> (<i>Girls, Guns &amp; Zombies</i>), you\u2019ll step into a gritty post-apocalyptic wasteland where survival depends on your wits, your allies, and the cards you play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This isn\u2019t just another deck-builder. It\u2019s survival \u2014 one draw at a time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4003430/extras/4554bcc83a1a8bf8c0ab8cfd0d917039.avif?t=1758950544\" width=1560 height=458 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83e\udddf Core Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple Game Modes</strong> \u2013 Face the infected in escalating <strong>Scavenging Operations</strong>, test your strategy in <strong>Skirmishes</strong>, or battle through epic <strong>Campaigns</strong> like <i>Uprising</i>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build Your Decks</strong> \u2013 Assemble survivors, scavenge supplies, and unlock powerful abilities. Create custom decks tailored to your playstyle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Scavenge &amp; Survive</strong> \u2013 Risk everything on runs for resources. The higher the threat, the greater the rewards.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Faction Warfare</strong> \u2013 Align with the tactical <strong>Nomads</strong>, the brute-force <strong>Brawlers</strong>, or the cunning <strong>Scavengers</strong>. Each faction comes with its own unique style and legendary cards.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The HUB</strong> \u2013 Trade supplies for new cards and packs. Expand your options and strengthen your forces.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Party Mode (Adults Only)</strong> \u2013 Take a break from the battlefield with a unique social mode. Flirt, mingle, and connect with characters around the campfire in this mature, story-driven experience.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4003430/extras/0661eb06e53148d989b06f56957ac206.avif?t=1758950544\" width=1560 height=458 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2694\ufe0f Will you lead humanity\u2019s last stand\u2026 or be swallowed by the horde?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The dead are waiting. Your deck is your weapon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <strong>GGNZ: Deck of the Dead</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4003430/extras/09231dfee32eb60c31a781787bba5367.avif?t=1758950544\" width=1560 height=458 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4003430?t=1758950544","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4003430/dbb089dd2cb02239a84cf6882997bcf2a96570f4/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1758950544","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4003430/91084849bfb7924b61eff349dbe4916b0d22b96d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758950544","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4003430/91084849bfb7924b61eff349dbe4916b0d22b96d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758950544","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,3,4,5],"notes":"GGNZ: Deck of the Dead contains the following content that may not be suitable for all audiences:\r\n\r\nViolence & Gore: Depictions of combat with zombies and other infected creatures, including blood, dismemberment, and horror elements.\r\n\r\nStrong Language: Dialogue may include profanity and mature themes.\r\n\r\nSexual Content (Adult Mode \u2013 \u201cParty\u201d): Optional gameplay mode includes flirtatious dialogue, suggestive themes, partial nudity, and sexual situations with fictional characters.\r\n\r\nAlcohol References: Some characters and environments depict drinking in social settings.\r\n\r\nAll characters are fictional and depicted as adults."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2623\ufe0f\u00a0<strong>Survive the end. Build your deck. Face the dead.\u00a0</strong>\u2623\ufe0f</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4003430/extras/04f91b7be7282cc1f4aaee3a919b83a9.avif?t=1758950544\" width=1560 height=458 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world is gone, but the fight isn\u2019t over. In <strong>GGNZ: Deck of the Dead</strong> (<i>Girls, Guns &amp; Zombies</i>), you\u2019ll step into a gritty post-apocalyptic wasteland where survival depends on your wits, your allies, and the cards you play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This isn\u2019t just another deck-builder. It\u2019s survival \u2014 one draw at a time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4003430/extras/4554bcc83a1a8bf8c0ab8cfd0d917039.avif?t=1758950544\" width=1560 height=458 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83e\udddf Core Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple Game Modes</strong> \u2013 Face the infected in escalating <strong>Scavenging Operations</strong>, test your strategy in <strong>Skirmishes</strong>, or battle through epic <strong>Campaigns</strong> like <i>Uprising</i>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build Your Decks</strong> \u2013 Assemble survivors, scavenge supplies, and unlock powerful abilities. Create custom decks tailored to your playstyle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Scavenge &amp; Survive</strong> \u2013 Risk everything on runs for resources. The higher the threat, the greater the rewards.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Faction Warfare</strong> \u2013 Align with the tactical <strong>Nomads</strong>, the brute-force <strong>Brawlers</strong>, or the cunning <strong>Scavengers</strong>. Each faction comes with its own unique style and legendary cards.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The HUB</strong> \u2013 Trade supplies for new cards and packs. Expand your options and strengthen your forces.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Party Mode (Adults Only)</strong> \u2013 Take a break from the battlefield with a unique social mode. Flirt, mingle, and connect with characters around the campfire in this mature, story-driven experience.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4003430/extras/0661eb06e53148d989b06f56957ac206.avif?t=1758950544\" width=1560 height=458 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2694\ufe0f Will you lead humanity\u2019s last stand\u2026 or be swallowed by the horde?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The dead are waiting. Your deck is your weapon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <strong>GGNZ: Deck of the Dead</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4003430/extras/09231dfee32eb60c31a781787bba5367.avif?t=1758950544\" width=1560 height=458 /></span></p>","developers":["Evil Bunneh"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4003430/6cfbe14be73f671f78949f386b989e5cd64572f8/header.jpg?t=1758950544","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"Girls Guns and Zombies: Deck of the Dead\u00a9 2025 Evil Bunneh. All rights reserved. Developed by Evil Bunneh. Girls Guns and Zombies and Evil Bunneh logos are trademarks or registered trademarks of Evil Bunneh. All other trademarks are property of their respective owners.","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4003430/1261125805/974d2b4d9d3b79ebdf797b956a0b51576d465096/1756800913/dash_av1.mpd?t=1758950540","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4003430/1261125805/974d2b4d9d3b79ebdf797b956a0b51576d465096/1756800913/dash_h264.mpd?t=1758950540","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4003430/1261125805/974d2b4d9d3b79ebdf797b956a0b51576d465096/1756800913/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1758950540","id":257192059,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257192059/movie480.mp4?t=1758950540","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257192059/movie_max.mp4?t=1758950540"},"name":"Cinematic Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/app